   "id": "root",
   "x": 183,
   "y": 10,
   "w": 760,
   "kind": "dark",
   "title": "Cord or root? Motor exam + the LOWEST sensory level",
   "lines": [
    "upper motor neuron (UMN), brain or cord: subtle bulk loss, tone ↑, hyperreflexia, upgoing toe",
    "lower motor neuron (LMN), root or nerve: wasting, tone ↓, reflexes ↓ or absent",
    "NO motor or sensory function below the level, incl. rectal tone + perianal sensation = COMPLETE"
   ]
  },
  {
