   "x": 45,
   "y": 156,
   "w": 668,
   "h": 78,
   "kind": "plain",
   "title": "CORD (myelopathy): UMN below the level",
   "lines": [
    "cervical → arms + legs · thoracic → both legs ± bowel, bladder",
    "incomplete: WHICH modalities are lost names the syndrome"
   ]
  },
